Every Friday: demo, check results + re-plan scope.", "originalText": "□ OCR: missing / unreadable answers are flagged.\n□ Grading: compare 30–50 samples with teacher marks;\n   meet the agreed tolerance + review disagreements.\n□ Results: marks stay within rubric limits; evidence\n   supports feedback; teacher can edit + approve.\n□ Integration: sign-up → upload → grade → review →\n   saved report works standalone + in Schoolmate.\n□ Campus: agreed college workflow passes end to end.\n□ Asstatic: record eligible → interested → confirmed\n   enrolments; set a target after checking batch size.\n□ Every Friday: demo, check results + re-plan scope.", "fontSize": 24, "fontFamily": 2, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "autoResize": true, "lineHeight": 1.25, "created": null, "labelPosition": null, "baseFontSize": null}, {"id": "plan_ced8a54fdd844521", "type": "rectangle", "x": 80, "y": 2150, "width": 2240, "height": 200, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#92400e", "backgroundColor": "#fef3c7", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": ["afb745d3b3dc"], "frameId": null, "index": "buV", "roundness": {"type": 3}, "seed": 79639447, "version": 2, "versionNonce": 1638233952, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1795159246945, "link": null, "locked": false, "customData": {"plan": "schoolmate-asstatic-nov2026"}, "created": null}, {"id": "plan_16a4b2fef7b048f7", "type": "text", "x": 104, "y": 2172, "width": 908, "height": 37.5, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#92400e", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": ["afb745d3b3dc"], "frameId": null, "index": "buW", "roundness": null, "seed": 776878890, "version": 2, "versionNonce": 253243040, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1795159246945, "link": null, "locked": false, "customData": {"plan": "schoolmate-asstatic-nov2026"}, "text": "START NOW / KEEP ONLY ONE PRODUCT TASK IN PROGRESS", "originalText": "START NOW / KEEP ONLY ONE PRODUCT TASK IN PROGRESS", "fontSize": 30, "fontFamily": 2, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "autoResize": true, "lineHeight": 1.25, "created": null, "labelPosition": null, "baseFontSize": null}, {"id": "plan_edc82c9279ca4bbf", "type": "text", "x": 104, "y": 2227, "width": 1321, "height": 93.75, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e293b", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": ["afb745d3b3dc"], "frameId": null, "index": "buX", "roundness": null, "seed": 990688975, "version": 2, "versionNonce": 817859424, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1795159246945, "link": null, "locked": false, "customData": {"plan": "schoolmate-asstatic-nov2026"}, "text": "1  List what already works + remaining blockers for each app.   2  Confirm batch end + the full-time course offer.\n3  Pick the first subject, rubric + sample papers.   4  Ask a college what its pilot must include.\nCapacity rule: if a milestone slips, reduce pilot scope before adding hours. AI grades need teacher approval in the pilot.", "originalText": "1  List what already works + remaining blockers for each app.   2  Confirm batch end + the full-time course offer.\n3  Pick the first subject, rubric + sample papers.   4  Ask a college what its pilot must include.\nCapacity rule: if a milestone slips, reduce pilot scope before adding hours. AI grades need teacher approval in the pilot.", "fontSize": 25, "fontFamily": 2, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "autoResize": true, "lineHeight": 1.25, "created": null, "labelPosition": null, "baseFontSize": null}], "appState": {"viewBackgroundColor": "#ffffff", "zoom": {"value": 0.4}, "scrollX": 0, "scrollY": 0}, "files": {}}